## ▶ How to Run
Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/NITESHSA1/ATP_24EG106A21.git
```

Navigate to the folder:

```bash
cd ATP_24EG106A21/session1_assignments
```

Run any file:

```bash
node filename.js
```

Example:

```bash
node Largest_among_2.js
```

